[N 43-44 Feralas]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Feralas from the east: the road from Gadgetzan through Thousand Needles to Thalanaar, the boat to Feathermoon Stronghold (flight point, bind), the Ruins of Solarsal, the Gordunni ogres of the High Wilderness, the Missing Courier chain to the Woodpaw gnoll camps, Yeh'kinya's screecher spirits, Rhapsody's bear and ape livers, and OOX-22/FE only if its beacon drops. Ends at Thalanaar for the flight to Theramore.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 43. Every quest needs only 39-40, but the Gordunni ogres run 42-45 (Brutes 42-43, Warlocks 43-44, Shaman 44-45) and the Rogue Vale Screechers 44-46. Under 43: in the ogre camp kill the Brutes and Warlocks first and leave the Shaman for last, after the apes and the screechers, and take the spirits from the low Vale Screechers (41-43)
[OC]|cffffffffFeralas|r  -  the Alliance hub is Feathermoon Stronghold on Sardor Isle off the west coast; Thalanaar is the night elf outpost on the east border. You arrive from Gadgetzan with hearth = Gadgetzan. About 18,700 quest XP from 12 hand-ins and 1g 75s of quest money. Camp Mojache (75,44) is a Horde town with level-55 guards between Thalanaar and the rest of the zone: every leg goes round it to the south
[OC]|cffffcc00Sources:|r givers, hand-ins, objects and mob positions come from the DB; the road from Gadgetzan, the Feathermoon ferry and its docks are not in it (unverified)
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r From Port to Port (95219, Friz Frazzlespark, chapter 42) is handed in at Feathermoon. Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452, with the 3 Roc Gizzards from chapter 46) gets its 3 Ironfur Livers and 3 Groddoc Livers here; the hand-in is Rhapsody in chapter 48. Screecher Spirits (3520, Yeh'kinya, chapter 46) is done here and handed in in chapter 51
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r no shaman trainer in Feralas; the level-44 row waits for Ironforge at the end of chapter 48

[OC]|cffffffffInto Feralas|r  -  Thalanaar's flight point is not known yet, so the first trip is by road: north from Gadgetzan to the Shimmering Flats, then west through Thousand Needles to the Feralas border (the road is not in the data, unverified)
Ride from Gadgetzan through Thousand Needles to Thalanaar on the east border of Feralas (road unverified) [G89.5,45.9 Feralas]
At [TAR4319 Thyssiana], the hippogryph master, get the [P Thalanaar] flight path [G89.5,45.9 Feralas]
[OC]|cFFFF0000Danger:|r Camp Mojache (Horde, level-55 Braves at 73-78,42-47) stands on the road west: keep to its south side
Ride west and kill every [TAR5268 Ironfur Bear] (41-42) between Thalanaar and Camp Mojache for 3 Ironfur Liver [CI6258,3] (~21% - budget ~14 bears in all; whatever is short, finish on the bears in the ogre country later) [G84.0,41.0 Feralas]
[OC]|cFFFF0000Danger:|r the coast round the Forgotten Coast dock has Sea Elementals (48-49) and the elite Wave, Shore and Deep Striders (47-49) along the shore (x35-47 y33-66): go straight to the dock and do not wander along the beach
Ride west round the south of Camp Mojache to the Forgotten Coast dock and take the boat to Feathermoon Stronghold on Sardor Isle (the ferry and its island dock are not in the data, unverified) [G45.6,43.4 Feralas]

[OC]|cffffffffFeathermoon Stronghold|r  -  flight point, bind and the pickups, all inside the walls
At [TAR8019 Fyldren Moonfeather], the hippogryph master, get the [P Feathermoon] flight path [G30.2,43.2 Feralas]
At [TAR7736 Innkeeper Shyria], bind your Hearthstone to [S Feathermoon] (Gadgetzan's bind from chapter 46 ends here) [G31.0,43.5 Feralas]
At [TAR7941 Mardrack Greenwell], [QT95219] (330 XP) [G31.0,43.1 Feralas]
At [TAR7900 Angelas Moonbreeze], [QA2982 The High Wilderness] (3,750 XP + 65s: 8 Gordunni Brutes, 8 Gordunni Warlocks and 8 Gordunni Shaman in the High Wilderness) [G31.8,45.6 Feralas]
At [TAR3936 Shandris Feathermoon], [QA2866 The Ruins of Solarsal] (2,700 XP: explore the ruins at the south of the island) [G30.3,46.2 Feralas]
At [TAR7877 Latronicus Moonspear] beside her, [QA4124 The Missing Courier] (360 XP: speak with Ginro Hearthkindle) [G30.4,46.2 Feralas]
At [TAR7880 Ginro Hearthkindle], [QT4124] (360 XP) [QA4125 The Missing Courier] (2,700 XP: find the courier's boat on the coast of Feralas) [G31.9,45.1 Feralas]

[OC]|cffffffffThe Ruins of Solarsal|r  -  south-west on the same island (on foot from the stronghold, unverified). Hatecrest naga round the ruins: Screamers and Wave Riders 41-42, Warriors and Sirens 42-43; nothing to kill for the quest, so pull only what stands in the way
At the Solarsal Gazebo in the ruins, [QT2866] (2,700 XP) [QA2867 Return to Feathermoon Stronghold] (1,800 XP: report to Shandris) [G26.3,52.3 Feralas]
