At [TAR7877 Latronicus Moonspear], [QT3130] (360 XP) [G30.4,46.2 Feralas]

[OC]|cffffffffThe south|r  -  boat back to the mainland, south to the courier's wreck, then east to the High Wilderness ogre camp (x58-64 y54-73) with the Groddoc apes, bears and Vale Screechers between the camp and Feral Scar Vale
Take the boat back to the Forgotten Coast dock (ferry unverified) [G45.6,43.4 Feralas]
[OC]|cFFFF0000Danger:|r a Sea Elemental (48-49) stands right by the wreck and an elite Deep Strider (47-49) a little further along the shore: come at it from inland, pull nothing, loot and leave east
At the Wrecked Row Boat on the south coast, [QT4125] (2,700 XP) [QA4127 Boat Wreckage] (375 XP: the Discarded Knife to Ginro) [G45.4,65.0 Feralas]
Kill 8 [TAR5232 Gordunni Brute] (42-43) in the north half of the ogre camp (Gordunni Maulers 43-44 share it and are not targets) [QC2982] [G60.5,57.5 Feralas]
Kill 8 [TAR5240 Gordunni Warlock] (43-44) in the middle of the camp [QC2982] [G59.8,64.7 Feralas]
Kill 8 [TAR5236 Gordunni Shaman] (44-45) at the south end of the camp (under 43: do this after the next two lines) [QC2982] [G60.8,67.8 Feralas]
Kill [TAR5260 Groddoc Ape] (42-43) between the camp and Feral Scar Vale for 3 Groddoc Liver [CI6259,3] (~26% - budget ~11 apes). Finish the Ironfur Livers here if you are short: [TAR5268 Ironfur Bear] (41-42) at 55-61,53-62 and [TAR5272 Grizzled Ironfur Bear] (44, ~27%) north and west of the camp; [TAR5352 Old Grizzlegut] (rare, 43, 59.5,59.4) drops one too if he is up [CI6258,3] [G58.5,58.5 Feralas]
Kill [TAR5307 Vale Screecher] (41-43, only four at 57-60,55-62) or [TAR5308 Rogue Vale Screecher] (44-46, north and west of the camp) and use Yeh'kinya's Bramble on the corpse to capture its spirit, 3 Screecher Spirits in all (bramble-on-the-corpse is the Classic way, unverified) [QC3520] [G58.3,58.5 Feralas]
[OC]|cffffcc00OOX-22/FE:|r every mob on this route can drop the OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon, at 0.34% per kill (Wowhead Forever, 13 Nov). Never farm it: the next three lines are yours only if it has dropped by now; otherwise skip them. Feral Scar yetis (43-46) stand round the robot's cave
