[O]Only if the beacon dropped: at [TAR7807 Homing Robot OOX-22/FE] in the cave, [QT2766] (3,900 XP) [QA2767 Rescue OOX-22/FE!] (4,850 XP at Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay, chapter 49) [G53.4,55.7 Feralas]
[O]|cFFFF0000ESCORT|r Only if you took it: escort OOX-22/FE north-west to the Forgotten Coast dock. Keep it inland: the walk passes Rogue Vale Screechers, Grizzled Ironfur Bears and Longtooth Howlers (43-46), and the coast has the elite striders; its path and any ambushes are unverified [QC2767] [G45.6,43.4 Feralas]
