[OC]|cffffffffEast to Thalanaar|r  -  boat to the mainland and ride east to the southern Woodpaw camps (Mystics and Reavers 42-43, Alphas 43-44 at x65-78 y51-57), then north-east past the south side of Camp Mojache to Thalanaar. Kill any Ironfur Bear on the way if you are still short of livers
Take the boat back to the Forgotten Coast dock (ferry unverified) [G45.6,43.4 Feralas]
